<title>USA: U.S. soybean weekly export sales highlights - USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. soybean weekly export sales highlights - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. soybean major sales activity in the week ended Aug 22 reported by exporters for the following purchasing countries, in tonnes:</p>
<p>Net Sales:  1995/96		     1996/97</p>
<p>China	 108,500-A	    Holland   180,900</p>
<p>Holland	35,600		Taiwan     54,000</p>
<p>Unknown    -114,000		Japan	32,000</p>
<p>Japan	 -52,800</p>
<p>A- includes 105,900 switched from unknown.</p>
<p>Note: weekly exports of 374,600 tonnes slipped four percent from previous week, but exceeded four-week average by 30 percent.</p>
<p>Primary Export Destinations: China, Japan, Taiwan, Mexico.</p>
</text>
